# Test Self-Reference Fix

### Test Create Form with Self-Reference (Should Now Work)
POST http://localhost:5070/api/forms
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Self Reference Test Form",
    "description": "Test form to verify self-reference fix",
    "fields": [
        {
            "id": "field1",
            "type": "text",
            "label": "New text field",
            "required": true,
            "order": 1,
            "conditionalLogic": {
                "enabled": true,
                "condition": "show",
                "operator": "and",
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "fieldId": "field1",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "test"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ],
    "settings": {
        "allowMultipleResponses": true
    }
}

### Test Create Form with Valid Cross-Reference
POST http://localhost:5070/api/forms
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Valid Cross Reference Test",
    "description": "Test form with valid conditional logic",
    "fields": [
        {
            "id": "field1",
            "type": "select",
            "label": "Trigger Field",
            "required": true,
            "order": 1,
            "options": ["Yes", "No"],
            "conditionalLogic": {
                "enabled": false
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "field2",
            "type": "text",
            "label": "Conditional Field",
            "required": false,
            "order": 2,
            "conditionalLogic": {
                "enabled": true,
                "condition": "show",
                "operator": "and",
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "fieldId": "field1",
                        "operator": "equals",
                        "value": "Yes"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ],
    "settings": {
        "allowMultipleResponses": true
    }
}